ed during this work:\n`cargo test` does **not** rebuild a `cdylib` (no Rust target can depend on one),\nso a source edit was invisible to the test run and every test passed against a\n**stale** `.so`. `tests/common/mod.rs` now compares the `.so` mtime against the\nnewest source mtime and fails loudly with `STALE SHARED OBJECT`, and\n`verify.sh` always runs `cargo build` before `cargo test`.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\necho \"unchecked rows remaining: $(grep -c '| \\[ \\] |' CONFIGS.md || true)\"\necho \"checked rows: $(grep -c '| \\[x\\] |' CONFIGS.md)\"","description":"Check off CONFIGS.md rows and append status"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4219,"cache_read_input_tokens":154662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4219,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc5fb11b-b0ae-4e15-9e57-f0582a95b100","uuid":"0b1c0700-8731-46d9-bc1c-2d05624e5938","timestamp":"2026-08-19T18:59:01.433Z"}
